SUMMARY:Toronto Babel: Fourth Anniversary Exchange & Social Event @ Rivoli
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\nWe’
 re back to our roots at the Rivoli for another night of great conversation
 \, community\, and global connections. Whether you want to practice Englis
 h\, learn a new language\, or simply make new friends from around the worl
 d\, this is the place to be!\n\n✨ **What to Expect:**\n✅ Language Exch
 ange 💬 – chat in French\, Spanish\, Korean\, Japanese\, and more!\n
 ✅ Live Music & Resident DJ 🎵 – groove while you mingle\n✅ Fun Boa
 rd Games 🎲 – challenge a new friend\n✅ Arts & Crafts 🎨 – get c
 reative\n✅ Make New Friends 🗣️ – the more\, the merrier!\n\n📍 
 334 Queen St. W.\, Toronto\, ON M5V 2A2\n🕖 6:30 PM – 11:00 PM\n\nCome
  solo or bring a friend—either way\, you’ll leave with new connections
 \, good laughs\, and even better vibes 💬✨🫶\n\n💵 $5 Entry Fee at
  the Door\nThis helps cover meetup essentials like games\, name tags\, sti
 ckers\, and all the little things that make our events magical ✨\n\n**CO
 NTACT:** Terry (Organizer)\n📲 E-transfer also available: tmg8@wealthsim
 ple.me\n🔗 Meetup: [https://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel](https://www.mee
 tup.com/TorontoBabel)\n📘 Facebook: [https://www.facebook.com/groups/tor
 ontobabel](https://www.facebook.com/groups/torontobabel)\n💬 WhatsApp: [
 https://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7](https://chat.whatsapp.co
 m/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7)\n📸 Instagram: [https://www.instagram.com/t.o.
 babel](https://www.instagram.com/t.o.babel)\n\n👉 Check out our calendar
  to see what other events we have coming up and to RSVP:\n[https://www.mee
 tup.com/TorontoBabel/#calendar](https://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calen
 dar)\n\n**Note:** Toronto Babel is a friendly\, welcoming\, and safe space
  for all attendees. This is a language-focused event and not a dating or m
 atchmaking event. Any form of harassment or inappropriate behavior will no
 t be tolerated. If you experience or witness any issues\, please inform on
 e of the organizers.\n\n#TorontoBabel #LanguageExchange #TorontoEvents #To
 DoToronto #LearnEnglish
